        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A removals company in Ireland with excellent reviews, a van fleet and a website that produced two or three quote requests a week."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The quote form asked for a full inventory before giving a price. Most people left. Google Ads was running on 'removals' alone, in competition with every man with a van in the country."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Pages for every move type: house, apartment, office, piano, international",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A two-step quote form: rooms and date first, inventory later",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Google Ads on specific moves and areas, not the generic term",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Reviews pulled onto every page, with a live count",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Call tracking and a same-hour callback promise",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Quote requests rose 175% in seven months and the cost per quote from ads fell 41%."
        }
      ]
    },
